WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:03.212
I've spent my life

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:04.630
trying to protect my family

00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:08.467
but I always lead them
into more danger.

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:10.969
I have cursed

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.554
everyone that I love

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:13.347
with war.

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.348
♪♪

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.104
Season 3

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.105
there are new threats

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:24.358
Baba Voss is just trying
to keep his family together

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:26.860
Baba is trying to stop these
powerful forces

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.528
threatening the world
in the name of science.

00:00:28.904 --> 00:00:30.030
This new weapon,

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.574
more powerful than you can
imagine.

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:35.702
Tormada is this mad-scientist
who discovers how to make bombs

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:38.038
and he's like a general to Edo.

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:41.625
Tormada is twisted and
all about what tools

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.252
can he use to
destroy his enemies.

00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:46.088
The enemy of my enemy
is my friend.

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.548
We will build
the greatest empire

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.050
this world has ever known.

00:00:50.342 --> 00:00:52.761
All of Paya will be ours.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:53.720
Bomb them.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.721
♪♪

00:00:56.265 --> 00:00:57.891
Theres a power struggle

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.601
between Sibeth and Maghra.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.728
Both women fight for
what they believe in.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.147
Your hands should stay clean.

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:05.732
It's too late for that.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.818
Violence must be met

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:08.694
with violence.

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:10.153
♪♪

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.655
There comes a point
where family

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:13.198
needs to put a line down

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:15.075
and make really
difficult decisions.

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.243
♪♪

00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:17.703
Her army is in Paya

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.705
with weapons of
thunder and fire.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:21.999
It's a very different
kind of threat

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:22.958
for Baba Voss.

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:23.834
♪♪

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:26.086
You need to ready your
army to march.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.005
You will have us go to war?

00:01:28.005 --> 00:01:29.298
You're already at war!

00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:30.048
Fire!

00:01:31.258 --> 00:01:36.513
♪♪

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:38.515
This season, the actions
just jacked up.

00:01:39.141 --> 00:01:40.642
And there's real sacrifices.

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:42.602
♪♪

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.353
Kill them!

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:44.062
Run!

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:46.064
I will die...

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:46.648
-No!

00:01:47.399 --> 00:01:49.151
before I allow anything
to happen to you.

00:01:51.987 --> 00:01:55.365
♪♪

